# Files kept in the repo but never deployed to Apps Script.
#
# main.gs is a stale full copy of the system: all 184 of its functions are
# also defined in the modular quantum_*/turo_*/PAM_* files, and it declares
# no top-level constants of its own. Apps Script puts every file in one
# global scope, so whichever definition loads last wins — and because main.gs
# is not in .clasp.json's filePushOrder it loaded last, silently overriding
# the newer modular versions (e.g. the 19-column setupImportHeaders was
# replaced by its old 16-column twin). Kept in git for reference only.
main.gs
main.gs.backup-v2.0.0

# Local tooling / docs — not part of the Apps Script project.
node_modules/**
.git/**
*.md
